[en.EVENT_C11_MAIN_5]
The Great Famine of the Changelings

[en.EVENT_C11_MAIN_5_desc]
With the complete depletion of the source of love, large-scale famine begins to appear in the territory of the Changeling Empire. The lives of the Changelings became increasingly difficult, and the ruler of the Changeling Empire, Queen Chrysalis, is under increasing pressure.
Due to her inability to fulfill her promises, Queen Chrysalis’ rule began to be questioned. Even though Queen Chrysalis executed several... or rather, a considerable number of opposition, her rule still began to shake...

[en.EVENT_C11_MAIN_5_o0]
